---
// ContactCTA.astro
---

<section style="padding-top: 80px; border-top: 1px solid #E5E5E5;">
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px;">
    <div style="padding: 32px; border-radius: 20px; background: #F5F5F7; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); transition: all 0.3s ease; text-align: center;">
      <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">♻️</div>
      <span style="font-family: 'PT Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #3A506B; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">Plan Retoma</span>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 12px 0; color: #000;">¿Vendes tu Apple?</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; margin: 0 0 20px 0; line-height: 1.5;">Cotiza en 2 minutos y recibe tu oferta inmediata.</p>
      <a href="/plan-retoma-apple" style="background: #000; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px;">Cotizar ahora</a>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 32px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #E5E5E5; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-align: center;">
      <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">💬</div>
      <span style="font-family: 'PT Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #3A506B; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">Soporte</span>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 12px 0; color: #000;">¿Dudas con la garantía?</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; margin: 0 0 20px 0; line-height: 1.5;">Respuesta garantizada en máximo 2 horas.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/573124813094" target="_blank" style="border: 1.5px solid #000; color: #000; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px;">Chat WhatsApp</a>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 32px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #E5E5E5; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-align: center;">
      <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">🔧</div>
      <span style="font-family: 'PT Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #3A506B; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">Reparación</span>
      <h3 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 12px 0; color: #000;">¿Necesitas reparación?</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; margin: 0 0 20px 0; line-height: 1.5;">Diagnóstico gratuito en 30 minutos.</p>
      <a href="/servicio-tecnico-apple" style="border: 1.5px solid #000; color: #000; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px;">Agendar Cita</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
